00:56:43.590 --> 00:56:55.890
<v Ira Glass>You know, I was in a long line at the coffee shop this week. And I got to the front, I was about to order, Torey walks in, cuts the line, comes right up to me. I told him, "Torey, you can't jump in front of all these people!"

00:56:55.890 --> 00:56:58.710
<v Ira Glass>He wouldn't listen. Put his hands over his ears says to me--

00:56:58.710 --> 00:57:04.350
